<Base title="About" description="Who Thomas Greco is and what this site is for.">
  <article class="about">
    <header class="head">
      <h1>About</h1>
    </header>
    <div class="prose">
      {/* Your words go here. The two paragraphs below are placeholders describing the site, not you. */}
      <p>
        This is the personal site of Thomas Greco, a software engineer working mostly in TypeScript and React.
      </p>
      <p>
        Posts marked with a mustard dot were first published at
        <a href="https://hindleymilner.com">Hindley Milner Systems</a> and are mirrored here with a link back to the
        original. Posts marked with a cobalt dot appear here first.
      </p>
      <p>
        The site is a static build. Once you have opened a page it stays readable offline. There is an
        <a href="/rss.xml">RSS feed</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
